flowchart TD
 S[Banking transaction] --> R[Internal third party sub tier risk graph]
 R --> P[Risk snapshot and PQC policy epoch]
 P --> Q[Select high-risk direct and sub tier providers]
 Q --> A[Separate ML-DSA signed acknowledgements]
 A --> V{Trusted signatures freshness record policy?}
 V -- No --> D[REJECT]
 V -- Yes --> G[Strict banking gateway]
 G --> B[Employee ML-DSA role-based authorization]
 B --> K[ML-KEM-768 or ML-KEM-1024]
 K --> E[HKDF-SHA256 plus AES-256-GCM]
 E --> Z[Authenticated encrypted record]
 Z --> T[Verify decrypt and reject replay]
 T -- Pass --> OK[ACCEPT]
 T -- Fail --> D
 R --> M[Migration counterfactual and delta risk per cost]
 M --> R
